The '''salve amulet''' is an offensive amulet that is made upon completion of the [[Haunted Mine]] quest, granting a 16.67%{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1171387277655846913|date=10 September 2019|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97380|archivedate=26 April 2020|quote=It's 1/6, so 16% is closer.}} increase in the wearer's [[Attack]] and [[Strength]] when fighting [[Undead (attribute)|undead monsters]].

The amulet is made by using a [[chisel]] on the [[crystal outcrop]] at the bottom level of the [[Abandoned Mine]], then using the acquired [[salve shard]] on a [[ball of wool]]; the [[String Jewellery]] spell will also work.

